Sun Dec 10 09:24:50 CET 2017

	Use i_ino that is immutable while the inode is in memory
	This fixes problems with ssh ControlMaster option

Sat Dec  9 05:41:16 CET 2017

	When compiling spadfsck, make it possible to select the type of
	asynchronous I/O using
		make AIO=posix
		make AIO=linux
		make AIO=posix,linux
		make AIO=linux,direct
	Make it possible to disable aio at runtime using --noaio

	Note - the current implementation of posix aio mostly degrades
	performance, so it is not recommended.
	AIO=linux,direct may or may not improve performance over buffered I/O,
	it has to be tested.

Fri Dec  8 06:39:11 CET 2017

	Fix some overflows that could happen on volumes larger than 256TiB

